## Guardrail

Fry @cutlets{800 g} ~{4 min / @&cutlets}.

Mix @flour{100 g}, @a{1 / 0 g @&flour} and @=b{1 / 100 g @&flour}.

Roast @roast{1 kg} ~{15 min / 500 g @&roast * 2}.

Add @yolks{2}<@eggs{1 / 100 g @&flour}> and @c{1 / 100 g de @&flour}.

Crush @garlic{3 cloves} and @d{1 / 2 slices @&garlic}.
